# Normalize everything to LF in the repository, regardless of contributor OS.
#
# This is not cosmetic. Two things depend on it:
#   - `cargo fmt --check` in CI compares against LF-formatted output.
#   - insta snapshot tests (P4) would otherwise produce CRLF-vs-LF diffs that
#     fail only on the Windows leg of the matrix.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Snapshots and fixtures are compared byte-for-byte; never let git rewrite them.
*.snap    -text
*.snap.new -text

# Binary types git should not try to diff or normalize.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
